TYPES OF QUEUE?

1. Array Blocking Queue. -- fixed size.
2. Linked Blocking Queue -- not fixed size (unbounded queue)


CachedThreadPool - Creates thread on demand. No queue.
SingleThreadPool - only one thread available. unbounded queue.
ScheduledThreadPool - run task in future.

